Z||000005||Haze_Performance||06-01-2000||03:12 AM||||Hey Oreif,<P>You've seen my car..What can I do to get it show ready?? I like to enter something but there are so many mod'ed out cars out there. Mine looks to plain.<P> <A HREF="http://geocities.com/MotorCity/Pit/5773/001_0a.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://geocities.com/MotorCity/Pit/5773/001_0a.jpg</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://geocities.com/MotorCity/Pit/5773/002_1a.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://geocities.com/MotorCity/Pit/5773/002_1a.jpg</A> <P>||||reg||5
Z||000006||Oreif||06-01-2000||12:14 PM||||Haze, They have 2 catagories. Stock and Modified. I've seen your car and it looks great! Just wash and wax it then under the hood and decklid you can wipe the metal areas and rubber seals down with WD40. Basically just clean, clean, clean! You'll most likely be in the stock catatgory and have a great chance of getting a trophy.<BR>(I'll be in the modified section)||||reg||6
